<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 97,700 MT were up 65 percent from the prior week and 19 percent from the 4-week average.  The major buyers were Mexico (75,100 MT) and Israel (20,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 125,200 MT were 17 percent over the previous week, but 7 percent below the 4-week average.  Mexico (75,900 MT) and Japan (42,200 MT) were the primary destinations.</p>
</text>
